sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Admin as Admin User
  participant ReactApp
  participant API as API Service (Axios)
  participant Flask as Flask Backend
  participant Auth as Flask-Login
  participant DB as MongoDB

  Admin->>ReactApp: Login (admin)
  ReactApp->>API: POST /api/login
  API->>Flask: /api/login
  Flask->>Auth: validate + set is_admin
  Flask-->>API: { user:{ is_admin:true } }
  API-->>ReactApp: store session/cookie

  Admin->>ReactApp: Open Admin Dashboard
  ReactApp->>API: GET /api/admin/predictions
  API->>Flask: /api/admin/predictions (login_required)
  Flask->>Auth: check current_user.is_admin
  Auth-->>Flask: allowed
  Flask->>DB: get all predictions
  DB-->>Flask: predictions[]
  Flask-->>API: { predictions:[...] }
  API-->>ReactApp: render table

  Admin->>ReactApp: Edit a prediction
  ReactApp->>API: PUT /api/admin/predictions/:id
  API->>Flask: authorize admin
  Flask->>DB: update prediction
  DB-->>Flask: ok
  Flask-->>API: 200 updated
  API-->>ReactApp: update row

  Admin->>ReactApp: Delete a prediction
  ReactApp->>API: DELETE /api/admin/predictions/:id
  API->>Flask: authorize admin
  Flask->>DB: delete prediction
  DB-->>Flask: ok
  Flask-->>API: 200 deleted
  API-->>ReactApp: remove row



